CASE|header_switch
=======================================================================================================
Invoking CPG generator in a separate process. Note that the new process will consume additional memory.
If you are importing a large codebase (and/or running into memory issues), please try the following:
1) exit joern
2) invoke the frontend: /Users/shayaunnejad/vibe-code/joern-oxidized/.local/astra-sprint/oracle/runtime/joern-cli/c2cpg.sh -J-Xmx4096m /Users/shayaunnejad/vibe-code/.codex-worktrees/joern-oxidized-astra-inactive-declarations/.local/inactive-declarations/header-switch/input/header_switch --output /Users/shayaunnejad/vibe-code/.codex-worktrees/joern-oxidized-astra-inactive-declarations/.local/inactive-declarations/header-switch/oracle-workspace/workspace/header_switch/cpg.bin.zip
3) start joern, import the cpg: `importCpg("path/to/cpg")`
